    "body": "#### vim-patch:9.2.1260: breakindent rendering repeatedly scans long wrapped lines\n\nProblem:  Rendering a long wrapped line with 'breakindent' repeatedly scans\n          the same line for every screen row.\nSolution: Cache the breakindent width for one win_line() invocation and add\n          a regression test for cache invalidation (Julien Voisin).\n\ncloses: vim/vim#21618\n\nhttps://github.com/vim/vim/commit/0cdd38226912a0821a104f7ce0bf4ef887e75344\n\nCo-authored-by: Julien Voisin <julien.voisin@dustri.org>",
    "closed_at": "2026-11-01T23:57:20Z",
